   "explanation": {
    "en": "The backbone is sugar and phosphate joined by phosphodiester bonds; bases hang off the deoxyribose by N-glycosidic bonds. A pairs with T by two hydrogen bonds, G with C by three. The two strands are antiparallel: the left strand runs 5' (top) to 3' (bottom).",
    "kn": "ಸಕ್ಕರೆ-ಫಾಸ್ಫೇಟ್ ಬೆನ್ನೆಲುಬು; A=T ಎರಡು, G≡C ಮೂರು ಹೈಡ್ರೋಜನ್ ಬಂಧಗಳು; ಎಳೆಗಳು ವಿರುದ್ಧ ದಿಕ್ಕಿನವು."
